Note: inclusive ranges in both directions — the negative-step bug
For i from 1 to 5
    Say i
End
For i from 0 to 10 step 2
    Say i
End
For i from 10 to 1 step -1
    Say i
End
Note: implicit-direction descending range (no step) is empty — default step is +1
For i from 5 to 1
    Say i
End
Say "liftoff"
